"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【宮城県】【2026年最新】宮城おすすめホテル・名湯温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">宮城県全域（仙台市街・秋保温泉・松島・鳴子温泉郷・遠刈田温泉）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/akita-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【秋田県】【2026年最新】秋田おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">秋田県全域（乳頭温泉郷田沢湖角館・男鹿半島・秋田市街・八幡平玉川温泉湯沢）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/features\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
}